{"title":"Petrified Oak Burl","slug":"Petrified_Oak_Burl","pageid":4404,"revid":20483,"timestamp":"2025-11-12T00:28:00Z","lastEditor":"BetaProto","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Burl","fields":[{"label":"$/burl","value":"$797"},{"label":"$/sanded","value":"$3986"},{"label":"Raw Image","value":"PetrifiedOakBurlDone.png"}]},"sections":[{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Burls/\">Burls</a> are a sub-resource of trees. <b>Petrified Oak Burls</b> spawn on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Petrified_Oak/\">Petrified Oak Trees</a>, down the grass ramp in the valley by Flora Laura's. They spawn rarely as one per tree, usually where the branches start to form, and rarely on the base.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0c994c4b579e8d24207b2e35ad22f3c8\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"POak_Burl_Tree-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Petrified Oak Burls in a tree\">Petrified Oak Burls in a tree</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Petrified Oak Burls in a tree\">Petrified Oak Burls in a tree</span></span></div></div><div>Petrified Oak Burls in a tree</div></div></div>\n\n</div>"}
